DESCRIPTION:SYNERGY 360° SESSION IS FINALLY HERE ☆ When she plays Fabric
  London\, Watergate Berlin and SASH Sydney... you listen. Monika Ross is b
 ack on the Gold Coast for a rare\, intimate 360° set. Synergy's first eve
 r boiler room-inspired session. The sound surrounds you\, the energy is in
  a circle. This is raw\, underground house\, minimal\, breaks & garage the
  way it's meant to be heard. With ROSSCO + Felipe Gonzalez opening the jou
 rney from 6pm in the Warehouse. Where the dancefloor surrounds the booth\,
  where we all become one\, connected by the rhythm of sound. ♡︎ We wel
 come Monika Ross\, Ross Weightman AKA ROSSCO\, Federico Gonzales\, Navarro
 (BR) B2B Rolo to bless your ear drums. All coming together to provide groo
 vy blends of banging electronic rhythms to take you on a journey. MONIKA R
 OSS Our headliner\, is a widely respected DJ and producer with raw\, authe
 ntic sounds that move effortlessly through minimal\, house\, breaks and ga
 rage. Fresh from her European tour\, we welcome her home. Her dynamic sets
  and signature sound have led to appearances at some of the most iconic ve
 nues worldwide including SASH (Sydney)\, Fabric (London)\, Club der Vision
 aere (Berlin)\, Watergate (Berlin)\, PAL (Hamburg)\, and Oxford Undergroun
 d (Sydney)\, among others. ROSS WEIGHTMAN (ROSSCO) Joining her is Ross Wei
 ghtman AKA ROSSCO\, spins house music rooted in deep\, funky\, progressive
  grooves\, to make you move. He has a big energy you will feel it when he 
 does what he loves! Beyond the booth\, you may also recognise him from Lov
 e Island Australia! FELIPE GONZALES Opening the journey is FELIPE GONZALEZ
 \, blending the ultimate progressive\, organic house with melodic sounds s
 ets shaped by his Argentinian roots. Felipe has the ability of reading the
  room and shapes his selections around the energy of the crowd. Get here e
 arly to watch the magic unfold. NAVARRO(BR) B2B ROLO Introducing Navarro(B
 R) & Rolo\, our Brazilian & Colombian DJ's\, producers of the movement Shu
 t Up and Dance\, also supported by Solomon\, the Martinez Brothers\, Frank
 y Rizardo\, we are delighted to welcome you to the Synergy family. Catch t
 he boys building the atmosphere from the ground up\, shaping the room and 
 we're excited to connect our communities together. Let's go! This is going
  to be one for the books. We would love YOU to experience it with us. Limi
 ted capacity\, don't sleep on it! ONE LOVE ♡︎ Synergy familiiiliaaaa 
 ꩜ Who are Synergy? heeEeelllloooo there :) we’re over the moon you fou
 nd us. Synergy is an independent music events organiser originating in Bri
 stol\, England\, that crossed the pond to sunny Straya. A collective built
  around the power of music to bring people together\, to bless your ear dr
 ums with incredible music. Our events create high energy spaces\, a dance 
 floor where you feel free\, a place to let loose\, get weird and be you :)
  A place you feel comfy. Like home. Surrounded by good vibez. With a focus
  on raw\, finely selected electronic music. A little gritty-funky-undergro
 und flavour. FOLLOW OUR JOURNEY - for more Synergy adventures ♡︎ @syne
 rgyevents._ Doors at 6pm (18+) with the venue's El Ranchero back deck and 
 bar open from 6pm for preshow dinner and drinks. SYNERGY Mo's Desert Clubh
 ouse / Burleigh Heads Friday 18 September 2026 Mo's is Burleigh Heads' mos
 t loved music venue\, licensed bars\, creative studios and cultural hub. T
 he Warehouse & El Ranchero both boast epic bar menus\, cocktails and craft
  beers. Mo's is a fully licensed venue\, all guests are required to show I
 D on entry. Tickets will only be refunded through event cancellation or pr
 oduction of a medical certificate within 24hrs of show doors.
